                <!-- <h1>YOUR PRIVACY</h1> -->
                <p>NTH Count  ("we," "our," "us") is committed to protecting and respecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines the types of personal data we collect, how we use it, how we share it, and the measures we take to keep it secure. It also informs you of your rights concerning your personal data. This Privacy Policy applies to all our technological and electronic election solutions for national elections, organizational elections, and other services provided by NTH Count (collectively referred to as "Services"). <p>

                  By using our Services, you agree to the collection, use, and disclosure of your information as described in this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree with any part of this Privacy Policy, please refrain from using our Services.
                </p>
                </p>
                <img src="images/Picture1.svg" alt="" srcset="">
                <img src="images/Picture2.svg" alt="" srcset="">
                <img src="images/Picture3.svg" alt="" srcset="">
